@startuml
title Suborder Handling and Student Status Query — Sequence DRAFT
actor Merchant
actor Student
participant "Ordering System" as System
participant "Suborder" as Suborder
participant "Inventory" as Inventory

Merchant -> System: Open own suborders
System -> Suborder: Find suborders for merchant
Suborder --> System: Own visible suborders and states
System --> Merchant: Show own suborders

Merchant -> System: Update suborder status
System -> Suborder: Validate allowed transition and update
Suborder --> System: Updated status
System --> Merchant: Show updated status

opt Merchant rejects a pending suborder
  System -> Inventory: Restore quantity-mode stock if item exists and its mode was not switched
  note right of Inventory
    Confirmed restoration follows FR-27.
    Restoration after inventory-mode change is Unconfirmed (G3-19).
    Whether deletion is allowed before rejection and how to restore after deletion is Unconfirmed (F-16).
  end note
end

Student -> System: Open or refresh own order details
System -> Suborder: Read order and visible suborders
Suborder --> System: Order ID, suborder IDs, details, amounts and statuses
System -> Suborder: Derive parent aggregate status from current suborder statuses
Suborder --> System: Aggregate status under FR-33
System --> Student: Show aggregate status and group visible suborder IDs by status, including 已拒單

Merchant -> System: Open or refresh own order details
System -> Suborder: Read own visible suborders and statuses
Suborder --> System: Parent order ID and own suborder IDs, details and statuses
System --> Merchant: Show own suborders grouped by status, without aggregate status

note over Merchant,Suborder
  Requirements: FR-21, FR-26–FR-30, FR-33
  Merchant visibility and state changes are limited to own suborders.
  State transitions (FR-26): 待接單 -> 已接單 or 已拒單; 已接單 -> 可取餐; 可取餐 -> 已取餐.
  已拒單 and 已取餐 are terminal.
  Student aggregate status is derived as specified by FR-33.
end note
@enduml
